# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
/android/
.superpowers/
*.tmp
export_presets.cfg
.import/

# Local git worktrees (subagent-driven-development isolation).
# Both paths matter: Claude Code creates them under .claude/worktrees/, and a
# committed worktree would put a second copy of every .uid file inside the
# project — Godot scans the whole directory, so each UID would then be claimed
# twice and resolve to neither. That is what broke tests/test_project_hygiene.gd
# on 2026-09-10. .claude/.gdignore keeps Godot out of there as a second guard.
.worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/
